1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,937
Any two pieces cut with the same enzyme have matching sticky ends, so they can pair up.

2
00:00:05,937 --> 00:00:11,757
Then the second tool, DNA ligase, the molecular glue, seals the backbone.

3
00:00:11,757 --> 00:00:17,395
Some enzymes, like Sma one, cut straight across and leave blunt ends.

4
00:00:17,395 --> 00:00:23,671
Arber, Nathans and Smith won the nineteen seventy eight Nobel Prize for discovering them.

